; Example (uncomment after installing environment\weathers\my_winter_rain.ltx):
; [weather_my_addon_winter_rain]
; style = 4
; category = rain
; cycle = my_winter_rain
;
; Categories: clear, partly, cloudy, rain, storm, foggy.
; Several entries for one style/category form a randomly selected pool.
; A missing pool uses the pack's original pool. Emission/weather effects are separate.
